  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> (where&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is the constant of integration) and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
